    "updated_at": "2026-11-08T23:00:09Z",
    "body": "I merged upstream/main into this branch; the merge applied cleanly. `scripts/gate.sh quick` on the merged branch is **fully green**: the motion suites, including `swarf_pose_continuity` 6/6, and all app suites.\n\n**For the maintainer:** this changes posted 5-axis swarf output. The contributor's only machine and simulator is a 3-axis Tormach 770MX in PathPilot Hub, which cannot run or simulate A/B/C moves, so no hands-on Hub or machine check was possible.\n- Safety is carried by the verifier laws listed above: the posed-rapid solid law checks every new held-pose rise, and `flank_clear` checks each half-radius sample.\n- A 5-axis controller or simulator run of a swarf program, before merge, is yours to judge. Marking ready on that basis.\n",
