    "body": "Re-gated after merging #446. The swarf pins are now `LINKS_DEBUG (23, 36)` and `LINKS_FULL (44, 69)`: this PR's lowered counts, plus #446's two-link Linux allowance on the advanced case, which is guarded turns in air only. The flank and turn checks are unchanged.\n- **motion suites:** all green, including `swarf_pose_continuity` 6/6.\n- **Remaining reds:** they also fail on main, namely #415 (`setup_stock_source`, fixed by #420) and the GPU headless tests.\n\nThe branch merges cleanly with main. Flagging ready again.",
